From 91ec92fcf841b23999f7b2a2e7d835b59f7ee8d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:05:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Read a picked-up review card's source links from the board
 replica

Pickup copies a card's parent edges only, and the feed keeps a link only when
its child is local, so a review card picked up on a worker lost its links to the
source cards: no implementer evidence, review refused. Review evidence now lists
a card's linked children from the live file and, on a synced board, the replica
(source_reader.children), which also covers links added after pickup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_review_model.py             |  3 +-
 hermes_cli/kanban_review_sources.py           | 39 ++++++++---
 .../test_kanban_review_source_replica.py      | 70 +++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

